From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Danny Lin <danny@kdrag0n.dev>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2020 01:47:31 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: configs: moto-holi: Don't sync when entering suspend

Syncing can take a long time in some cases, and the risk of us losing
power or crashing while in suspend on a battery-backed device is very
low. Android also enters and exits suspend very frequently, which
exacerbates the cost.

Change-Id: I35b9cb3e79532e18b2240b377b20708eae86cec2
Signed-off-by: Sevenrock <sevenrock@hotmail.de>
---
 arch/arm64/configs/vendor/lineage_moto-holi.config | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/vendor/lineage_moto-holi.config b/arch/arm64/configs/vendor/lineage_moto-holi.config
index e176a3fff74b..f2a4d0fcb54f 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/vendor/lineage_moto-holi.config
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/vendor/lineage_moto-holi.config
@@ -90,3 +90,4 @@ CONFIG_CC_OPTIMIZE_FOR_PERFORMANCE_O3=y
 # CONFIG_REGULATOR_QTI_DEBUG is not set
 # CONFIG_COMMON_CLK_QCOM_DEBUG is not set
 # CONFIG_INTERCONNECT_TEST is not set
+CONFIG_SUSPEND_SKIP_SYNC=y
-- 
2.39.5

